"description.  Find the current binding in the keybindings menu.  Short "
"descriptions are read in the list.  Longer descriptions open a document: use "
"the arrow keys to read its parts, then Escape to return to the same list "
"entry.  If an entry has no description, the game says 'No details available.'"
